---
description: Mobile-first responsive UI rules for admin and web apps
globs: apps/admin/**,apps/web/**,packages/ui/**
alwaysApply: agent
---

## Mobile-First UI (MANDATORY)

All UI must be mobile-first. Write base styles for mobile, use `md:`/`lg:` prefixes to scale up. Never assume a desktop viewport.

### Dashboard layout

The admin sidebar must use a collapsible drawer on mobile:

```tsx
// Desktop: persistent sidebar
<aside className="hidden md:flex h-full w-64 flex-col border-r bg-card">

// Mobile: Sheet/drawer — toggled from header hamburger button
<Sheet>
  <SheetTrigger asChild>
    <Button variant="ghost" size="icon" className="md:hidden">
      <Menu className="h-5 w-5" />
    </Button>
  </SheetTrigger>
  <SheetContent side="left" className="w-64 p-0">
    <SidebarContent />
  </SheetContent>
</Sheet>
```

### Page headers

Stack title and action button on mobile; row on `sm:`:

```tsx
<div className="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
	<h1 className="text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Page Title</h1>
	<Button className="w-full sm:w-auto">Action</Button>
</div>
```

### Tables

Always wrap in a horizontally scrollable container. Hide low-priority columns on small viewports:

```tsx
<div className="rounded-md border overflow-x-auto">
	<Table className="min-w-[480px]">
		<TableHead className="hidden md:table-cell">Secondary Column</TableHead>
		<TableHead className="hidden lg:table-cell">Tertiary Column</TableHead>
		...
		<TableCell className="hidden md:table-cell">...</TableCell>
	</Table>
</div>
```

For tables with 5+ columns, add a card-list fallback for mobile:

```tsx
{
	/* Mobile only */
}
<div className="space-y-3 md:hidden">
	{items.map((item) => (
		<div key={item.id} className="rounded-lg border p-4 space-y-2">
			...
		</div>
	))}
</div>;
{
	/* Desktop only */
}
<div className="hidden md:block rounded-md border overflow-x-auto">
	<Table>...</Table>
</div>;
```

### Dialogs / forms

```tsx
// Full-width on mobile, constrained on sm+
<DialogContent className="w-full max-w-lg sm:max-w-xl">

// Action buttons: full-width stacked on mobile
<div className="flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:justify-end">
  <Button variant="outline" className="w-full sm:w-auto">Cancel</Button>
  <Button type="submit" className="w-full sm:w-auto">Save</Button>
</div>
```

### Stat/card grids

```tsx
<div className="grid gap-4 grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
```

### Touch targets

All interactive elements must be at least 44×44px. Use `size="icon"` on icon-only buttons:

```tsx
<Button variant="ghost" size="icon" className="h-9 w-9">
	<MoreHorizontal className="h-4 w-4" />
</Button>
```

### Spacing

```tsx
// Tighter on mobile, expand on desktop
<main className="p-4 md:p-6">
<section className="space-y-4 md:space-y-6">
```

### Anti-patterns — NEVER do these

```tsx
// ❌ Fixed widths that overflow
className="w-[800px]"

// ❌ Desktop sidebar with no mobile handling
<aside className="w-64">  // no md: guard

// ❌ Bare Table without overflow wrapper
<div className="rounded-md border"><Table>

// ❌ Small touch targets
<button className="p-1"><Icon /></button>
```
